{"title":"DESTROYER OF WORLDS","slug":"DESTROYER_OF_WORLDS","hero":{"file":"DESTROYER_OF_WORLDS_2.webp","width":400,"height":381},"pageid":4752,"revid":22041,"timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:13:47Z","lastEditor":"Dasuperstar","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Pickaxe","fields":[{"label":"Swing Power","value":"1.5"},{"label":"Swing Distance","value":"20 studs"},{"label":"Swing Time","value":"2"},{"label":"AOE Distance","value":"5 studs"},{"label":"Pickaxe Power","value":"2"},{"label":"Price","value":"$376000 (in 8 Emberbanes’ materials)"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.97.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"obtaining","text":"Obtaining"}],"body":"<blockquote><p><i><big>\"???\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-10-05-42-42-62 507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e\">Screenshot 2025-12-10-05-42-42-62 507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Screenshot_2025-12-10-05-42-42-62_507ff6669c2c4ef3cc2fd79388a54e6e.jpg/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"obtaining\">Obtaining</h2>\n<ol><li>Obtain the following materials:\n<ol><li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> x 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lab_Card/\">Lab Card</a> Does not consume</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> Does not consume (Bombs could also be used to blow up ice)</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a> Does not consume (For mobile use)</li></ol></li></ol>\n<ol><li>Go to the first seven locations on the map and use <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> to melt the ice. And placing <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> into the stone Grudge statue's mouth, the statue eyes will turn yellow and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> will be consumed.\n<ol><li>View pictures of the observatory’s second floor, excluding the observatory itself or the ice cave location.</li></ol></li></ol>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: SecondFloorInObservatory\">SecondFloorInObservatory</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/SecondFloorInObservatory.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Unmelted\">Unmelted</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar4.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Unmelted</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ol><li><ol><li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: see fig\">see fig</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: see fig\">see fig</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar1.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><i>see fig</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar2\">Altar2</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar2\">Altar2</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar2.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Enter through here\">Enter through here</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Enter through here\">Enter through here</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/GoAltar2.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>Enter through here. Above is Station A</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar3\">Altar3</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar3\">Altar3</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar3.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar4Map\">Altar4Map</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar4Map\">Altar4Map</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar4Map.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar5\">Altar5</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar5\">Altar5</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar5.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar6\">Altar6</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar6\">Altar6</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar6.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7.png\">Altar7.png</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7.png\">Altar7.png</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar7.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gizmo's_Observatory/\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>Use the lab card to open the passage<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: use lab card\">use lab card</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: use lab card\">use lab card</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Use_lab_card.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>use lab card</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7Look\">Altar7Look</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Altar7Look\">Altar7Look</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Altar7Look.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go to the final location. Melt the ice above the huge ice block to open the entrance, and place <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> into the last one.\n<ol><li>Closest entry, burn the ice with <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a>, then go straight until you see a rock cover with ice stuck at the ceiling.<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Closest entry\">Closest entry</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Closest entry\">Closest entry</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Closest_entry.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>Keep looking to your right and ceiling to locate the rock. Then jump on the ice on the right ice wall, after jump to the highest point, use <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> to burn the ice that covers the rock. After the ice melt, jump down in to the broken hole.<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GoAltar8\">GoAltar8</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GoAltar8\">GoAltar8</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/GoAltar8.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>After jump down the hole, you can use <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a> to run faster. Use the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> for the last ice, then use the 8th <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a>. If done successfully, the <strong>DESTROYER OF WORLDS</strong> will spawn after the final ice is melt.<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating 7\">After activating 7</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: After activating 7\">After activating 7</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/InAltar8.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>After activating 7</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol></li></ol></li>\n<li>Take your <strong>DESTROYER OF WORLDS</strong></li></ol>"}
